// The credential form, OTP challenge, push approval and the busy overlay are still on the legacy
// components because they carry ~90% of the traffic and the MDC form field renders 4px taller,
// which shifted the "Forgot username" link under the fold on the 360px breakpoint in UAT
// (KEY-2233). Brand and accessibility both need to sign off on the new layout and neither has had
// time.
//
// So: BOTH theme mixins are included. Yes this doubles the emitted theme CSS (~110kb before
// compression, see the budget bump in angular.json). Yes there are visual regressions where a
// legacy button sits next to an MDC checkbox (the ripple colours differ, the focus ring is a
// different width, and the disabled grey is off by a few shades). I ran out of runway before the
// 2024.03 train and this is what got us through it. Finish it or revert it, but do not leave it
// like this for another year.
//
